  "abstract": "Following the successful validation of the Delta-SOTA paradigm (ID 245) and the confirmation that curvature loss is still beneficial (ID 249), this experiment tunes the curvature loss hyperparameter. The hypothesis is that the optimal lambda value for the Delta-Space paradigm may differ from the standard paradigm's 1e-4. This submission tests this by increasing the lambda to 1e-3, aiming to find a better optimum and further improve the SOTA score.",
